# Everything is checked out with LF, also on Windows with core.autocrlf on: the hook scripts match
# their own Markdown with \n (a CRLF working-style.md broke session-start's LOCAL_AGENT_STE switch).
* text=auto eol=lf
# Windows batch files need CRLF line endings (cmd.exe misreads ^ continuations without them).
*.cmd text eol=crlf
